    {
      "id": "p0160-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "A seahorse monster named Aaron loves bodybuilding, muscles, and flirting with other characters. In his notes, Toby describes Aaron as \"a buff horse whose Airty actions border on creepy\".",
        "raw": "A seahorse monster named Aaron loves bodybuilding, muscles, and flirting\nwith other characters. In his notes, Toby describes Aaron as \"a buff horse\nwhose Airty actions border on creepy\".",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.29462605,
          0.23702143,
          0.87147659,
          0.28550714
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29258464,
          0.23630714,
          0.90964069,
          0.28657857
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          8,
          9,
          10
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "海马怪物 Aaron 热爱健身、肌肉，也喜欢和其他角色调情。Toby 在注释里把他形容为“一匹肌肉发达的马，调情举动已经接近让人发毛的程度”。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
