    {
      "id": "p0160-b010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby not d that this this seemingly random line is actually a direct quote from a bodybuilding character in Breath ofF ire II. The translator used Toby's notes to find the equivalent Japanese line from Breath ofF ire II in order to preserve the reference in the Japanese Undertale script. Fortunately, the Breath ofF ire II line is the same in Japanese and English, so no extra adaptation work was needed.",
        "raw": "Toby not d that this this seemingly random line is actually a direct quote from a\nbodybuilding character in Breath ofF ire II. The translator used Toby's notes to\nfind the equivalent Japanese line from Breath ofF ire II in order to preserve the\nreference in the Japanese Undertale script. Fortunately, the Breath ofF ire II line\nis the same in Japanese and English, so no extra adaptation work was needed.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
